acle-pnfp-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PNFP 2025 Q2","e":"pnfp","d":"2025-07-16","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Harold R. Carpenter","x":"Along with strength in core banking fees and BHG's estimated growth this year, we are comfortable increasing our guidance from 8% to 10% growth to now 12% to 15% growth in fees this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/pinnacle-pnfp-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PNFP 2025 Q3","e":"pnfp","d":"2025-10-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"M. Turner","x":"…that would materialize over the next 5 years, again, with no further hiring and irrespective of tariffs, Fed rate moves, general economic conditions and so forth, simply based on the continued consolidation of relationships by the relationship managers on our payroll at that time. And third…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/pinnacle-pnfp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PNFP 2025 Q3","e":"pnfp","d":"2025-10-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Harold Carpenter","x":"Even as all the uncertainties around rates and tariffs play out, we are confident that 2025 will shape up to be one of the best years we've experienced in our 25-year history and provides a great deal of momentum as we prepare to head into 2026 with our new partners at Synovus.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/pinnacle-pnfp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PNFP 2025 Q3","e":"pnfp","d":"2025-10-16","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Harold Carpenter","x":"Along with BHG's estimated growth this year, we are comfortable increasing our guidance for non-interest income from 12% to 15% growth to now 20% to 22% growth this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/pinnacle-pnfp-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PNFP 2025 Q4","e":"pnfp","d":"2026-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Blair","x":"It's no it's not lost on anyone that tariffs still play